WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.050
- If you heard the name of this show

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.103
you've heard of our first guest.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.730
She sold over 25 million albums.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.080
She's won, yes.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.470
She's won The Voice four times.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.963
She's the winner of two sports Emmys.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.410
She does it all.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.980
(audience clapping)

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.400
She's a mother of two beautiful children

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.400
and I'm using her dressing room today.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.940
So let's say hi to Kelly Clarkson.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.836
(audience cheering)

00:00:28.836 --> 00:00:31.230
(upbeat music)

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.063
You know,

00:00:32.063 --> 00:00:34.410
I started to show up looking
like that today, Kelly,

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.139
but I didn't wanna do you like that

00:00:37.139 --> 00:00:40.619
- Sometimes women don't rise Taraji,

00:00:40.619 --> 00:00:41.452
Sometimes,
- Hey, look,

00:00:41.452 --> 00:00:42.533
- Sometimes we fall.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.123
- But you got up 'cause
you're on the screen.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.800
- Look, I thought,

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.620
I thought we were done with quarantining.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.193
And I'm so tired.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.090
I broke a nail. I'm so broken.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.722
This is me broken.

00:00:58.722 --> 00:01:00.540
All my makeup's expired.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.200
America, this is what I
look like. You're welcome.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.340
- Well, let me say this to you, Kelly,

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:08.333
this is the first time I've
left my house since Christmas.

00:01:09.283 --> 00:01:12.700
(audience clapping)

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:13.980
Oh, you got,

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:16.110
You got a couple of people
wanna say hi to you.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:17.630
Y'all, y'all.

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:18.463
- [Kelly] Hi.

00:01:18.463 --> 00:01:20.260
- Hi Kelly. We miss you.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:21.413
- Come back, come back.

00:01:22.575 --> 00:01:24.770
(audience clapping)

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:26.921
- So is there anyone
else you wanna talk to?

00:01:26.921 --> 00:01:28.260
- Oh my God.

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:31.470
Hey, Roman, are you wearing
a superhero costume?

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:34.460
- No, I went, you know, Saved by the bell.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.480
You weren't here.

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:37.285
- Saved by the bell Zack attack!

00:01:37.285 --> 00:01:39.480
- Yeah it is, (indistinct).

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.525
- I miss y'all.

00:01:41.525 --> 00:01:44.661
I'm not even sick. It's so weird.

00:01:44.661 --> 00:01:47.830
Anyway, we're keeping
it safe and that's that.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.350
- It's okay if you have wine in that mug,

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:50.650
we'll pretend it's coffee.

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.483
It's happy hour somewhere!

